a:["$","p",null,{"children":"Yes: they speak the same protocol against the same endpoint. Each\ntool hashes its actions differently, so tools won't share entries\nwith each other, but every client of the same tool and toolchain\nwill."}]
b:["$","$L9",null,{"title":"Why does the instance name matter so much?","id":"why-does-the-instance-name-matter-so-much","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":["The instance name selects which configured store or scheduler a\nrequest is routed to. If a client sends an instance name the server\ndoes not expose, Forge rejects the request with an error of the\nform ",["$","code",null,{"children":"'instance_name' not configured for '...'"}],"; depending on the\nclient, that shows up as a cache warning or a failed build rather than\na cache hit. Every client targeting a cache must send an instance name\nthe server exposes."]}],["$","a",null,{"href":"https://github.com/toxicwind/forge/blob/v1.6.5/forge-service/src/ac_server.rs","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","data-source-link":"forge-service/src/ac_server.rs","data-source-ref":"v1.6.5","title":"forge-service/src/ac_server.rs at v1.6.5","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md border border-border bg-surface-elevated px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground no-underline transition-colors hover:border-brand/50 hover:text-brand","children":[["$","svg",null,{"width":"12","height":"12","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"m16 18 6-6-6-6M8 6l-6 6 6 6"}]}],"inner_get_action_result"]}]]}]
c:["$","$L9",null,{"title":"Which client is the fastest way to try Forge?","id":"which-client-is-the-fastest-way-to-try-forge","children":["$","p",null,{"children":["If you're on CMake,\n",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/getting-started/connect-your-build/cmake-recc","children":"recc in cache-only mode"}],"\nneeds no worker fleet and no build-file changes. For Bazel, two\n",["$","code",null,{"children":".bazelrc"}]," lines against the ",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/getting-started/quickstart","children":"Quickstart"}]," server\ndo it."]}]}]
